# Walkthrough: On-Demand Intraday Focus Radar & Master Trigger Switch

We have implemented and verified the **On-Demand Intraday Focus Radar & Live Hotlist Tape** with an operator-controlled Master Switch (`[⚪ INTRADAY RADAR: OFF]` / `[🟢 RADAR ARMED (N)]`).

The system adheres strictly to the requirement of **zero synthetic or placeholder data**, performing live microstructure queries via Upstox API v2 with full 1.0% risk budgeting, without causing any regressions in the existing 5-pillar fundamental screener, swing radar, or quantitative invariants.

---

## 1. Architecture & Key Features

```mermaid
graph TD
    UI[Dashboard Header: Master Switch] -->|Toggle Armed / Disarmed| IFM[IntradayFocusManager Singleton]
    IFM -->|3.5s Micro-Burst Poller| UPSTOX[Upstox API v2 Market Quote Batch]
    UPSTOX -->|1 Single HTTP Call for Basket| DEPTH[L2 Order Book Depth & VWAP]
    DEPTH --> MICRO[Microstructure Analytics Engine]
    MICRO -->|OBI Calculation| OBI[Order Book Imbalance Gauge]
    MICRO -->|VWAP & Delta| VWAP[Institutional VWAP Reclaim Trajectory]
    MICRO -->|ORB-15 Detection| ORB[Opening Range Breakout Sentinel]
    MICRO -->|Absorption Check| TRAP[Anti-Absorption Trap Warning]
    MICRO -->|1.0% Capital Budgeting| TICKET[Zerodha / Upstox MIS Order Ticket]
    TICKET --> TAPE[Reactive Live Hotlist Tape UI]
```

### Core Components Implemented:
1. **`src/analytics/intraday_focus_manager.py`**:
   - **Singleton Architecture**: Centralized thread-safe lifecycle with zero CPU and zero API hits when disarmed.
   - **Dynamic Focus Basket**: Capped at 3 to 8 high-conviction in-play stocks (sliding window prevents bloat).
   - **Single-Request Batched Fetch**: Comma-separated query strings (`instrument_key=NSE_EQ|INE...,NSE_EQ|...`) execute 1 HTTP request across all basket equities every 3.5s (consuming < 4% of Upstox rate limits).
   - **Order Book Imbalance (OBI)**: Evaluates buyer vs. seller dominance:
     $$\text{OBI Ratio} = \frac{\text{Total Buy Qty}}{\text{Total Buy Qty} + \text{Total Sell Qty}}$$
     Detects aggressive bid stacking ($>65\%$) vs. heavy ask walls ($<38\%$).
   - **Exchange VWAP & Distance %**: Tracks institutional cost basis and breakout/reclaim status.
   - **Anti-Absorption Trap Sentinel**: Flags setups printing near Session Highs but encountering heavy sell walls ($OBI \le 40\%$).
   - **1-Click Broker Order Ticket (MIS)**: Strict 1.0% account risk budget calculations with guaranteed stop loss anchor below entry and multi-stage profit targets (T1: 2R, T2: 3R).

2. **Market Hours Guard (`is_indian_market_open`)**:
   - Added to background workers in `scripts/launch_app.py` and `intraday_focus_manager.py`.
   - Prevents background workers from polling outside 09:15–15:30 IST on trading days (Monday–Friday).

3. **Dashboard UI Polish (`dashboard/index.html`)**:
   - **Market Session Indicator**: Real-time badge in header (`🔴 NSE: CLOSED` or `🟢 NSE: OPEN (09:15-15:30 IST)`).
   - **Master Radar Trigger**: Header button with glowing pulse animation when armed (`[🟢 RADAR ARMED (N)]`) and low-profile muted state when disarmed (`[⚪ INTRADAY RADAR: OFF]`).
   - **Live Hotlist Tape Container**: Collapsible top-of-workspace container displaying active cards with real-time OBI visualizer bars, VWAP delta indicators, `🗑️ Clear` button, and quick-add input (`+ Add symbol`).
   - **Ubiquitous Focus Pinning**:
     - `🎯 Focus` button in **Tab 2 Watchlist Explorer Table** under the Actions column for every stock.
     - `🎯 +Focus Tape` and `⚡ MIS Ticket` in **Stock 360° Profile Modal** header.
     - `🎯 +Focus` button on **Intraday Scalp cards** in Tab 4 Screener.
   - **1-Click Execution Modal**: Pre-formatted with Zerodha GTT syntax, copy button, and Upstox MIS API payloads.

